{"workflow":{"id":22267,"name":"Fetch daily German construction tenders with GAEB data using Apify","views":0,"recentViews":0,"totalViews":0,"createdAt":"2026-11-02T22:30:29.006Z","description":"## Quick overview\nThis workflow runs every weekday morning and calls an Apify actor to fetch newly published German construction tenders that include GAEB bill-of-quantities positions, then formats each tender into a readable summary with keyword hit snippets for downstream use.\n\n## How it works\n1. Runs at 07:00 (Europe/Berlin) every Monday to Friday.\n2. Sends a POST request to the Apify API to run the “german-construction-tenders-gaeb” actor synchronously with filters such as publication window, CPV prefixes, keywords, GAEB-only, and maximum tender count.\n3. Parses the returned dataset items and, for each tender, extracts key fields like buyer, submission deadline, location, GAEB position count, and documents URL.\n4. Matches keyword hits against GAEB positions and generates short text excerpts/snippets around the first matched keyword to provide context.\n5. Outputs one formatted item per tender, including a prebuilt multi-line message summarizing the tender and up to five keyword-hit positions.\n\n## Setup\n1. Create an Apify account, get an API token, and replace `YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` in the Apify request URL (or store it as an n8n HTTP Query Auth credential parameter named `token`).\n2. Adjust the Apify request JSON body to set your desired filters (for example `keywords`, `cpvPrefixes`, `pubDaysBack`, and `maxTenders`).\n3. (Optional) Add region filters like `postalCodePrefixes` or `nutsPrefixes` to the Apify request body to narrow results and keep the sync run within the timeout.\n\n## Requirements\n- An Apify account and API token for the German Construction Tenders + GAEB Extractor ([https://apify.com/brsksr/german-construction-tenders-gaeb](https://apify.com/brsksr/german-construction-tenders-gaeb)). No German procurement portal accounts or logins are required.\n\n## Customization\n- Filter by specific German postal code prefixes (postalCodePrefixes, e.g., [\"10\", \"80\"]), NUTS regions (nutsPrefixes), or custom product keywords inside GAEB .x83, .d83, and .p83 Bills of Quantities.\n\n## Additional info\nCovers ~85% of public German construction notices via oeffentlichevergabe.de, including Cosinex, subreport ELViS, evergabe.de, Deutsche eVergabe, evergabe-online.de, AI NetServer (HAD, Hessen, BW), and Healy Hudson (Deutsche Bahn, Hamburg).","workflow":{"meta":{"templateCredsSetupCompleted":false},"name":"Daily German construction tenders with GAEB positions to Google Sheets and email (Apify)","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"93eae260-3fc5-592a-8633-377c1e240cd9","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-608,-160],"parameters":{"width":480,"height":900,"content":"## Daily German construction tenders with GAEB positions to Google Sheets and email (Apify)\n\n### How it works\n\nOn weekdays at 07:00 (Europe/Berlin) this workflow calls the [German Construction Tenders + GAEB Extractor](https://apify.com/brsksr/german-construction-tenders-gaeb) on Apify. The Actor loads new public construction tenders (CPV 45) from oeffentlichevergabe.de and searches inside their GAEB bills of quantities (`.x83`, `.d83`, `.p83`) for your keywords.\n\n1. **Filter** keeps only tenders with a title and at least one GAEB position.\n2. **Remove Duplicates** drops every tender already seen in an earlier execution, so the overlapping date window never causes a second alert.\n3. **Code** builds clean fields plus the matching bill-of-quantities positions with a text snippet.\n4. Each new tender is **appended to Google Sheets**, and all of them are **combined into one daily email**.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Replace `YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN` in the **Run Apify Actor** URL with your token from [Apify Console -> Settings -> Integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n- In **Append to Google Sheets**, select your Google Sheets credential, replace `YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID` and create a header row: `noticeId, title, buyer, deadline, place, gaebPositions, keywords, firstHit, documentsUrl`.\n- In **Send Daily Email Digest**, select your Gmail credential and replace `YOUR_EMAIL@example.com`.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change `keywords`, `cpvPrefixes`, `maxTenders` or add `postalCodePrefixes` / `nutsPrefixes` in the JSON body.\n- The window is 2 days (4 on Mondays, so Friday to Sunday are covered). Overlapping days are loaded and billed again by Apify; Remove Duplicates only prevents duplicate alerts.\n- Swap Gmail for Outlook, Slack or Microsoft Teams, or Google Sheets for Airtable or your CRM."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"1fbd76ac-9845-5608-99c4-a7445fe9851c","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-60,-160],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":840,"height":340,"content":"## 1. Fetch & deduplicate official notices\n\nWeekday trigger -> synchronous Apify Actor run -> keep valid tenders with GAEB positions -> drop tenders already seen in previous executions."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"703b16f7-57e3-5235-8ab1-cfdc3a8f5604","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[840,-280],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":700,"height":580,"content":"## 2. Enrich, log to Google Sheets & send daily digest\n\nFormat buyer, deadline, place and matching BoQ positions. Then append one row per new tender to Google Sheets and send all of them as one email."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"d2567a05-e62c-5687-ba48-d213e47453b2","name":"Every Weekday at 07:00","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[0,0],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"cronExpression","expression":"0 0 7 * * 1-5"}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"9e1ac2ea-5998-590d-a8d2-985f7838fdea","name":"Run Apify Actor","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[220,0],"parameters":{"url":"https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/brsksr~german-construction-tenders-gaeb/run-sync-get-dataset-items?token=YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN","method":"POST","options":{"timeout":310000},"jsonBody":"={\n  \"pubDaysBack\": {{ $now.setZone('Europe/Berlin').weekday === 1 ? 4 : 2 }},\n  \"cpvPrefixes\": [\"45\"],\n  \"keywords\": [\"Wärmepumpe\", \"Photovoltaik\"],\n  \"onlyWithGaeb\": true,\n  \"maxTenders\": 20\n}","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json"},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"11bbd833-e0bd-560c-9212-33bb7fabc008","name":"Filter Valid Tenders","type":"n8n-nodes-base.filter","position":[440,0],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"1a6dc2d9-23ed-5536-a683-50044d4feb8d","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"exists","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.title }}","rightValue":""},{"id":"185f54a8-e1e7-5202-83f1-ee8c187fa077","operator":{"type":"string","operation":"exists","singleValue":true},"leftValue":"={{ $json.noticeId }}","rightValue":""},{"id":"4bc18d84-d712-5e0d-8fcf-4b286d0e478a","operator":{"type":"number","operation":"gt"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.positionCount }}","rightValue":0}]}},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"7c8caa80-14f7-5b1f-bad5-1c831ff63a93","name":"Remove Already Seen Tenders","type":"n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates","position":[660,0],"parameters":{"options":{"historySize":10000},"operation":"removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions","dedupeValue":"={{ $json.noticeId }}"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"5af16d28-b589-5016-b6fc-f6b88a0e007c","name":"Format Tender Details & Snippets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[900,0],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// One output item per tender: buyer, deadline, place of performance, number of GAEB positions and the\n// bill-of-quantities positions whose short/long text matched your keywords (with a text snippet).\nconst SNIPPET = 160; // characters of context around the keyword\n\nfunction snippet(text, keyword) {\n  if (!text) return '';\n  const flat = text.replace(/\\s+/g, ' ');\n  const i = flat.toLowerCase().indexOf(keyword.toLowerCase());\n  if (i < 0) return flat.slice(0, SNIPPET);\n  const start = Math.max(0, i - SNIPPET / 2);\n  return (start > 0 ? '…' : '') + flat.slice(start, start + SNIPPET) + (start + SNIPPET < flat.length ? '…' : '');\n}\n\nconst out = [];\nfor (const { json: t } of $input.all()) {\n  if (!t.title) continue; // empty run\n  const byOz = new Map((t.positions || []).map((p) => [p.oz, p]));\n  const hits = (t.keywordPositionHits || []).map((h) => {\n    const p = byOz.get(h.oz) || {};\n    const kw = h.keywords[0];\n    return {\n      oz: h.oz,\n      keywords: h.keywords.join(', '),\n      shortText: p.shortText || '',\n      quantity: p.quantity ?? null,\n      unit: p.unit || '',\n      excerpt: snippet(p.longText || p.shortText, kw),\n    };\n  });\n  const loc = t.location || {};\n  const place = [loc.postalCode, loc.city].filter(Boolean).join(' ') || loc.region || 'n/a';\n  const deadline = t.submissionDeadline\n    ? new Date(t.submissionDeadline).toLocaleString('de-DE', { timeZone: 'Europe/Berlin' })\n    : 'n/a';\n  const lines = hits.slice(0, 5).map(\n    (h) => `  • OZ ${h.oz}: ${h.shortText} (${h.quantity ?? '?'} ${h.unit}) – „${h.excerpt}“`,\n  );\n  out.push({\n    json: {\n      noticeId: t.noticeId,\n      title: t.title,\n      buyer: t.buyer?.name || 'n/a',\n      deadline,\n      deadlineType: t.deadlineType,\n      place,\n      gaebPositions: t.positionCount,\n      matchedKeywords: (t.matchedKeywords || []).join(', '),\n      firstHit: hits.length ? `OZ ${hits[0].oz}: ${hits[0].shortText} – ${hits[0].excerpt}` : '',\n      keywordHits: hits,\n      documentsUrl: t.documentsUrl,\n      message: [\n        `🏗️ ${t.title}`,\n        `Vergabestelle / Buyer: ${t.buyer?.name || 'n/a'}`,\n        `Frist / Deadline: ${deadline} · Ort / Place: ${place}`,\n        `GAEB-Positionen / BoQ positions: ${t.positionCount} · Keywords: ${(t.matchedKeywords || []).join(', ') || '–'}`,\n        ...lines,\n        `Unterlagen / Documents: ${t.documentsUrl}`,\n      ].join('\\n'),\n    },\n  });\n}\nreturn out;\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"62628de1-24a3-515f-af6a-8793350e08a7","name":"Append to Google Sheets","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[1140,-160],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"buyer":"={{ $json.buyer }}","place":"={{ $json.place }}","title":"={{ $json.title }}","deadline":"={{ $json.deadline }}","firstHit":"={{ $json.firstHit }}","keywords":"={{ $json.matchedKeywords }}","noticeId":"={{ $json.noticeId }}","documentsUrl":"={{ $json.documentsUrl }}","gaebPositions":"={{ $json.gaebPositions }}"},"schema":[{"id":"noticeId","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"noticeId","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"title","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"title","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"buyer","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"buyer","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"deadline","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"deadline","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"place","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"place","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"gaebPositions","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"gaebPositions","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"keywords","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"keywords","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"firstHit","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"firstHit","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"documentsUrl","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"documentsUrl","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":[],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Sheet1"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID"}},"typeVersion":4.5},{"id":"0ce9cbac-88d4-59a1-886c-97dc50e679d2","name":"Combine Into Daily Digest","type":"n8n-nodes-base.aggregate","position":[1140,120],"parameters":{"options":{},"fieldsToAggregate":{"fieldToAggregate":[{"fieldToAggregate":"message"}]}},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"71e93262-2889-5101-b193-fe150e356c7e","name":"Send Daily Email Digest","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[1380,120],"parameters":{"sendTo":"YOUR_EMAIL@example.com","message":"={{ $json.message.join('\\n\\n────────────────────\\n\\n') }}","options":{"appendAttribution":false},"subject":"=GAEB tenders {{ $now.setZone('Europe/Berlin').toFormat('dd.MM.yyyy') }}: {{ $json.message.length }} new construction tenders","emailType":"text"},"typeVersion":2.1}],"pinData":{},"settings":{"timezone":"Europe/Berlin","executionOrder":"v1"},"connections":{"Run Apify Actor":{"main":[[{"node":"Filter Valid Tenders","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Filter Valid Tenders":{"main":[[{"node":"Remove Already Seen Tenders","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Every Weekday at 07:00":{"main":[[{"node":"Run Apify Actor","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Combine Into Daily Digest":{"main":[[{"node":"Send Daily Email Digest","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Remove Already Seen Tenders":{"main":[[{"node":"Format Tender Details & Snippets","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Format Tender Details & Snippets":{"main":[[{"node":"Append to Google Sheets","type":"main","index":0},{"node":"Combine Into Daily Digest","type":"main","index":0}]]}}},"lastUpdatedBy":1,"workflowInfo":{"nodeCount":11,"nodeTypes":{"n8n-nodes-base.code":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.gmail":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.filter":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.aggregate":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote":{"count":3},"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger":{"count":1},"n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates":{"count":1}}},"status":"published","reviewStatus":"published","readyToDemo":null,"user":{"name":"brsksr","username":"brsksr","bio":"","verified":false,"links":[""],"avatar":"https://gravatar.com/avatar/6e327eb8bbe21fff25ac601260a62beee3128b279f2ba5afcb615d965cc5b942?r=pg&d=retro&size=200"},"nodes":[{"id":18,"icon":"file:googleSheets.svg","name":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","codex":{"data":{"alias":["CSV","Sheet","Spreadsheet","GS"],"resources":{"generic":[{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/love-at-first-sight-ricardos-n8n-journey/","icon":"❤️","label":"Love at first sight: Ricardo’s n8n journey"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/why-business-process-automation-with-n8n-can-change-your-daily-life/","icon":"🧬","label":"Why business process automation with n8n can change your daily life"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/automatically-adding-expense-receipts-to-google-sheets-with-telegram-mindee-twilio-and-n8n/","icon":"🧾","label":"Automatically Adding Expense Receipts to Google Sheets with Telegram, Mindee, Twilio, and n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/supercharging-your-conference-registration-process-with-n8n/","icon":"🎫","label":"Supercharging your conference registration process with n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/creating-triggers-for-n8n-workflows-using-polling/","icon":"⏲","label":"Creating triggers for n8n workflows using polling"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/no-code-ecommerce-workflow-automations/","icon":"store","label":"6 e-commerce workflows to power up your Shopify s"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/migrating-community-metrics-to-orbit-using-n8n/","icon":"📈","label":"Migrating Community Metrics to Orbit using n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/automate-google-apps-for-productivity/","icon":"💡","label":"15 Google apps you can combine and automate to increase productivity"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/your-business-doesnt-need-you-to-operate/","icon":" 🖥️","label":"Hey founders! Your business doesn't need you to operate"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/how-honest-burgers-use-automation-to-save-100k-per-year/","icon":"🍔","label":"How Honest Burgers Use Automation to Save $100k per year"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/how-a-digital-strategist-uses-n8n-for-online-marketing/","icon":"💻","label":"How a digital strategist uses n8n for online marketing"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/why-this-product-manager-loves-workflow-automation-with-n8n/","icon":"🧠","label":"Why this Product Manager loves workflow automation with n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/sending-automated-congratulations-with-google-sheets-twilio-and-n8n/","icon":"🙌","label":"Sending Automated Congratulations with Google Sheets, Twilio, and n8n "},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/how-a-membership-development-manager-automates-his-work-and-investments/","icon":"📈","label":"How a Membership Development Manager automates his work and investments"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/aws-workflow-automation/","label":"7 no-code workflow automations for Amazon Web Services"}],"primaryDocumentation":[{"url":"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/app-nodes/n8n-nodes-base.googlesheets/"}],"credentialDocumentation":[{"url":"https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/google/oauth-single-service/"}]},"categories":["Data & Storage","Productivity"],"nodeVersion":"1.0","codexVersion":"1.0"}},"group":"[\"input\",\"output\"]","defaults":{"name":"Google Sheets"},"iconData":{"type":"file","fileBuffer":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,"},"displayName":"Google Sheets","typeVersion":5,"nodeCategories":[{"id":3,"name":"Data & Storage"},{"id":4,"name":"Productivity"}]},{"id":19,"icon":"file:httprequest.svg","name":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","codex":{"data":{"alias":["API","Request","URL","Build","cURL"],"resources":{"generic":[{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/2021-the-year-to-automate-the-new-you-with-n8n/","icon":"☀️","label":"2021: The Year to Automate the New You with n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/why-business-process-automation-with-n8n-can-change-your-daily-life/","icon":"🧬","label":"Why business process automation with n8n can change your daily life"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/automatically-pulling-and-visualizing-data-with-n8n/","icon":"📈","label":"Automatically pulling and visualizing data with n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/learn-how-to-automatically-cross-post-your-content-with-n8n/","icon":"✍️","label":"Learn how to automatically cross-post your content with n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/automatically-adding-expense-receipts-to-google-sheets-with-telegram-mindee-twilio-and-n8n/","icon":"🧾","label":"Automatically Adding Expense Receipts to Google Sheets with Telegram, Mindee, Twilio, and n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/running-n8n-on-ships-an-interview-with-maranics/","icon":"🛳","label":"Running n8n on ships: An interview with Maranics"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/what-are-apis-how-to-use-them-with-no-code/","icon":" 🪢","label":"What are APIs and how to use them with no code"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/5-tasks-you-can-automate-with-notion-api/","icon":"⚡️","label":"5 tasks you can automate with the new Notion API "},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/world-poetry-day-workflow/","icon":"📜","label":"Celebrating World Poetry Day with a daily poem in Telegram"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/automate-google-apps-for-productivity/","icon":"💡","label":"15 Google apps you can combine and automate to increase productivity"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/automate-designs-with-bannerbear-and-n8n/","icon":"🎨","label":"Automate Designs with Bannerbear and n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/how-uproc-scraped-a-multi-page-website-with-a-low-code-workflow/","icon":" 🕸️","label":"How uProc scraped a multi-page website with a low-code workflow"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/building-an-expense-tracking-app-in-10-minutes/","icon":"📱","label":"Building an expense tracking app in 10 minutes"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/5-workflow-automations-for-mattermost-that-we-love-at-n8n/","icon":"🤖","label":"5 workflow automations for Mattermost that we love at n8n"},{"url":"https://n8n.io/blog/how-to-use-the-http-request-node-the-swiss-